tempt to do the unthinkable: save your beloved from the depths of Lukomorye\u2019s underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746310/extras/819023beac7a0fefcc099589e22ca7f9.poster.avif?t=1751141114\" width=600 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746310/extras/819023beac7a0fefcc099589e22ca7f9.webm?t=1751141114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746310/extras/819023beac7a0fefcc099589e22ca7f9.mp4?t=1751141114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story </strong>-<strong> </strong>A reimagining of Orpheus and Eurydice through the lens of war, memory, and myth. Uncover a tale of love, grief, duty, and what lies beyond death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Third-Person Shooter </strong>- Play solo or with a friend as the soldier and the siren. Using gritty WWI firearms, supernatural abilities, fairytale items, and synchronized combat to survive overwhelming odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Challenging Foes </strong>\u2013 Face bosses like Leshy, Nightingale the Robber, and Viy.  These spirits of nature, vengeance, and death are only beaten by working together to balance attack with defence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746310/extras/44cd6cd20448aeaf1131f78c16fb610f.avif?t=1751141114\" width=600 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic